<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>媽媽買了一個蛋糕，哥哥吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>，妹妹吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>。還剩幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> = ？（三個分數相加）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">四、生活應用題（共 5 題）<span class="star">🎯</span></div>
