<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span> = ？（和=1，分子等於分母）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>判斷對錯：<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。如果錯，寫出正確答案。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
